@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Reject Evaluation Report

DEVELOPER OWNER: Haya
MODULE: Sourcing Manager Review
TRELLO TASK: Reject Evaluation Report
TRELLO URL: Not provided — add from the Trello board

PURPOSE:
Reject the detailed report. The decision is stored on the
report version it applies to.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Manager

ROUTE: /SourcingManager/Reports/Reject/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- POST Reject: set ReviewedByUserId, ReviewComment,
  ReviewedAt and the report Status on this version only.
- Notify the Sourcing Officer; write AuditLogs.
- Never change committee scores or votes.

DEPENDENCIES:
TenderReports, Notifications, AuditLogs.

